From: Cyrene963 <Nitrogen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 14:43:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(memory): add context-aware field matching policy check

Add generic field_matches_context preflight check to support
context-bound recipient validation for delivery tools.

- field_matches_context: compare tool arg field against execution_context
- _resolve_path: dot-notation path resolution into nested dicts
- _mask_value: safe logging that masks recipient identifiers
- on_missing_context: configurable fail/warn/pass (default: fail)
- field_session_chat_id: deprecated backward-compatible alias
- build_preflight_policy: builds execution_context from user_context
- 28 tests covering matching, mismatch, missing context, masking, E2E

Out of scope: cron/deep-work integration (follow-up issue)
